{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act32side_level_act32side_07_beg",
  "groupId": "act32side",
  "stageId": "act32side_07",
  "title": "安全出口",
  "storyCode": "CR-7",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act32side/level_act32side_07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "ab7184316d561b21a1969a818c220b29e7405117c6f679bdba34e5621e290fec",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "48_g5_galleries"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "报告上尉，开幕式的观众已经全都被我们控制住，雷内尔也已经被我们绑在阳台上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，接应都就位了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们安排的十五辆卡车全都停在艺术馆的围墙外面了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接下来要干什么，不用我再说了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "记得警告那些大老粗，把艺术品搬上车的时候别弄坏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是谁敢弄坏一件东西，我就断掉他的一根手指。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，还有，记得收缴那些老爷们的终端。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那他们身上的财物，我们是不是也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，你倒是很懂啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对人怎么样我不管，但对那些艺术品，一定记得轻拿轻放。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走吧，我还得去会会雷内尔先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "48_g10_deluxeroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天亮了，日出好看吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不对，按照你们这种文化人的调调，我该问你，“美吗”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷内尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打算沉默了？别以为保持沉默就能保你平安。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过话又说回来，也确实没什么需要你说的。你只要在这里老老实实坐着，扮演好恐怖袭击受害人就够了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷内尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——你打算让我当恐怖袭击受害人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看，这不是开口了嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷内尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，我的错。我以为你看穿了什么，但我又想了想，不对，只是个利欲熏心的傻瓜炮制的巧合而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瞧瞧你，刚刚还装得大义凛然的，现在就开始撒脾气了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷内尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我对这个巧合毫无怨言，因为我发现，它只会为我最终的创作增光添彩——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷内尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然，因为这是个巧合，而非你有意为之，所以我只会感谢命运，而不是你，上尉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很好，你还是闭嘴吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上尉，上尉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么了？有人闹起来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，其实......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们还是到房间里说吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "48_g2_galleriessquare"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老爹，难道我们记错日期了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不可能。你看广场上的样子，刚才还有很多人在这里。肯定是发生什么事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有人看见了我们，给雷内尔报了信，他就跑回艺术馆里面去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这不是雷内尔的风格。假如他真的知道你们要来，他也许会暴怒，也许会兴奋，但绝对不会像你说的那样一躲了之。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那这......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "终端？我的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂？埃内斯托？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么样，你的私事有进展了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "阿莱塔，通知街头艺术社区的人，至少在今天，别靠近艺术馆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？为什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "艺术馆里面铺设了大量源石爆炸物，随时可能爆炸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "源石爆炸物？\n这......啊哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "阿莱塔，你笑得我心慌。你现在到底在哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所有人，我，艾拉他们，特克诺，迪亚兹，街头艺术社区的人......所有人都在艺术馆前面的广场上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "那你们还不赶快走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，老兄，因为我也有个问题想问你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埃内斯托，你为什么知道得这么清楚？你现在在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，我知道了。现在把你知道的所有信息都告诉我吧，埃内斯托。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "阿莱塔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不然我就要两眼一抹黑地去救你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "饭桶！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还让你告诉那些人别把艺术品弄坏了，你倒是先给我打碎一个！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上尉，这件事您先听我说完！那个打碎的陶瓶里面有......有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......源石爆炸物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "源石爆炸物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，不止——不止这一枚炸弹！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "属下刚刚上楼的时候，发现楼梯间里的墙面不太对劲，好像是新补过的，按说不应该这样......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就把墙打破了？里面也有炸弹？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是炸弹，而是......控制炸药起爆的节点。也就是说，起爆地点不止一处，炸药的量可能比我想象的还要多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "48_g10_deluxeroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷内尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——你打算让我当恐怖袭击受害人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷内尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以为你看穿了什么，但我又想了想，不对，只是个利欲熏心的傻瓜炮制的巧合而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上尉，那些东西会把整个艺术馆夷平的！而且我们甚至不知道那些东西到底怎么起爆，是人工操控的还是定时的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们抓紧时间把现有的东西装车，把那些阔佬的钱拿走，这事就这么算了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你甘心这么一走了之？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "炸弹就在艺术馆里，这不是甘不甘心的问题了，上尉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这事做不成，我们就是联合政府和多索雷斯的公敌了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要能跑掉，他们也不能拿我们怎么样！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跑到哪里？荒野上去吗？每个人分个几百金券，然后就地解散？我们拼死拼活就为了这个？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是——上尉，真的，大不了我们去国外当佣兵——当土匪！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "土匪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我只是随口一说，但我们真没必要用命陪着雷内尔发疯啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行，我知道了。还有谁知道这件事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只有我，我不敢告诉任何人，怕弟兄们知道了之后人心不稳，直接就来找您了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你做得很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去吧，告诉他们，不用再搬那些东西了，把楼下那群达官显贵的油水榨干净，我们立刻就撤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "带队的军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢您！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，还有，别慌慌张张的，说话要稳，走路要慢，别让他们看出端倪，听见了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "军人正转过身，拔腿往楼下冲，突然，他听见了弓弦的响声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他还没来得及回头，一支重型弩箭从背后贯穿了他的胸膛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小子，在这么多钻营，这么多布置，下了这么多决心，断了这么多后路之后......去当土匪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我早就没有回头的机会了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "48_g2_galleriessquare"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一场“拼接起来”的恐怖袭击？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "布设炸弹的雷内尔和控制人群的上尉好像都不知道对方要做什么，反正埃内斯托是这么说的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "双月",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......两个疯子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这两个人确实很疯。我们必须按最坏的可能做准备，一切以被卷入事件的人质优先。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "商议一下具体的行动方案。我方人员总共五名，双月、医生、导火索、我，还有罗德岛的空爆......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还得算我一个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你确定？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别忘了我以前是做什么的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再说，既然艺术馆里困着的不光雷内尔那个混球，也不光那群投资客，还有那么多普通人，我没理由不去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老爹......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用劝我，我是一定要去的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁要劝你了？我也要去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亚兹",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1214_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你和其他人就算了，那里面相当危险——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老爹，你也不想想，除了没当过消防员，你说的话哪条不是大家心里想的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大伙儿听我说，我们现在要去艺术馆里面救人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这件事完全自愿，想去的人到前面来，听艾拉他们的指挥！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克诺",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不想去也没关系，赶紧回社区，免得马特奥在完蛋之前对我们的社区动手脚，把我们也拖下水！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社区小贩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们怎么说，去吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社区居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我直说，我怕死，我不去，还有许多照片等着我拍呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社区小贩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（耸肩）我倒是挺想看看那群艺术投资客吓得屁滚尿流的样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社区画家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "低俗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社区小贩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "低俗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社区画家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "屁滚尿流有什么好看的。我要看的是雷内尔买来的那些艺术品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社区画家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我原以为那些东西只有给雷内尔交门票钱才能看，现在可不一样，我们是去救人的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社区居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你、你、你要是这么说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社区小贩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你突然掏雷内尔的传单干什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社区居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社区居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克里斯达尔艺术馆二号展厅展品第14号。萨尔贡占领米诺斯前夜，米诺斯一个无名诗人的手稿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社区居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这么美的诗，这么珍贵的手稿，怎么就被雷内尔买了下来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社区居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我甚至为了这首诗专门学了米诺斯语！我现在就背给你们听——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社区画家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打住，你背了我也听不懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社区居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社区画家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，你怎么就哭起来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社区居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一想到那个诗人的坎坷命运，再想想这份手稿，再想想我自己，我、我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社区居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我要去，就算看到手稿的同时炸弹爆炸也值了，我必须去！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "考虑到被困的人质数量，我们可以把大多数人手派去疏散被解救出来的人质，控制主谋和排爆的工作还是交给我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "空爆，龙舌兰现在能接通吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "龙舌兰先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "艾拉小姐？别告诉我你也要跟着阿莱塔一起闯进艺术馆，这里很危险——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们是这方面的专业人士，龙舌兰先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "空爆说你被困在艺术馆东侧三楼的一间暗室里，里面全是源石爆炸物。楼下闹哄哄的，应该关了不少人，对吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "里面有没有上尉的人？他们发现炸弹了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "人应该有，但太嘈杂，我听不清......等等——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "龙舌兰先生？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙舌兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "（小声）刚刚有两个士兵从暗室门口经过。他们正在商量怎么把艺术品搬走装车。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，我们会以此为前提来制定计划。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）我说，这么小的东西，真的能炸到里面那些人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）艺术馆的玻璃幕墙也就算了，这栋仓库楼可是被马特奥当作在艺术馆外围的指挥节点的，墙体说不定也加固过了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "导火索",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）当然能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）可......就算你正用绳索挂在二楼外面，也是在墙外啊......不是应该砸破窗户，把这东西丢进去吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掩体背后的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你听见什么动静了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掩体背后的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好像是......咚、咚、咚？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掩体背后的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明明是五声咚吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掩体背后的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掩体背后的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "管他是三声还是五声，反正我们可以守着这些掩体直到我们老死，那些家伙只能在广场上傻站着——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "导火索",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "布置完毕，该撤了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "楼内传来一连串爆炸声。\n空爆张大了嘴，看着导火索，正要说出佩服的话，导火索却对她摇了摇头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "房间内紧接着就发生了更加剧烈的爆炸。霰射炸药精准地引燃了里面的爆炸物储藏箱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "导火索",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾拉，这里是导火索。预计在外围布防的敌人马上就要出来了。做好接战准备。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "导火索",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "空爆，我们也该动起来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些人......不是应该已经被爆炸放倒了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "导火索",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "永远别把你的敌人当傻瓜，就算他们真的是傻瓜也不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "远处的军人们",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敌袭，敌袭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......难道是什么天才？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "导火索",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪有什么天才。我有的不过是训练，侦察，队友间的配合，再加一点点技术。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "导火索",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就这么简单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
